1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,008
Video ya leo inahusu nini? Maisha ya vijijini nchini Japani.

2
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:11,508
Sehemu ya 1: Salamu baada ya kuhamia / Utangulizi baada ya kuhamia

3
00:00:11,508 --> 00:00:13,041
Hujambo.

4
00:00:13,064 --> 00:00:16,064
Hujambo, habari?

5
00:00:16,087 --> 00:00:19,353
Nimekuja kukusalimia baada ya kuhamia.

6
00:00:19,376 --> 00:00:22,413
Aa, asante sana.

7
00:00:22,437 --> 00:00:27,124
Jana nilihamia nyumba ya kale iliyoko pembeni.

8
00:00:27,148 --> 00:00:29,215
Ndiyo hivyo?

9
00:00:29,238 --> 00:00:31,848
Jina lako nani?

10
00:00:31,871 --> 00:00:34,004
Mike.

11
00:00:34,027 --> 00:00:36,481
Nimetoka Marekani.

12
00:00:36,504 --> 00:00:38,675
Mike, basi?

13
00:00:38,698 --> 00:00:41,735
Kiswahili chako kinaelewa vizuri.

14
00:00:41,759 --> 00:00:46,400
Hapana, sijakielewa vizuri bado.

15
00:00:46,424 --> 00:00:50,499
Umetoka wapi Marekani?

16
00:00:50,522 --> 00:00:52,997
Nimetoka New York.

17
00:00:53,021 --> 00:00:54,892
New York?

18
00:00:54,916 --> 00:00:57,649
Mji mkubwa sana.

19
00:00:57,672 --> 00:01:01,919
Ndiyo, mji mkubwa sana.

20
00:01:01,943 --> 00:01:05,209
Kwa nini ulikuja kijijini hapa?

21
00:01:05,232 --> 00:01:09,365
Napenda vijiji vya kimya nchini Japani.

22
00:01:09,388 --> 00:01:11,388
Ndiyo hivyo?

23
00:01:11,411 --> 00:01:13,978
Hiyo ni nzuri sana.

24
00:01:14,001 --> 00:01:18,168
Nyumba hii ni kubwa na ya zamani sana.

25
00:01:18,191 --> 00:01:22,067
Ndiyo. Ilijengwa miaka 100 iliyopita.

26
00:01:22,090 --> 00:01:26,690
Miaka 100 iliyopita? Hiyo ni ajabu!

27
00:01:26,713 --> 00:01:29,646
Je, ni mara yako ya kwanza kuishi vijijini?

28
00:01:29,669 --> 00:01:33,079
Ndiyo, mara yangu ya kwanza.

29
00:01:33,103 --> 00:01:36,437
Je, nyumba yako huko New York ilikuwa kubwa?

30
00:01:36,460 --> 00:01:41,660
Hapana, ghorofa yangu huko New York ilikuwa ndogo.

31
00:01:41,684 --> 00:01:43,450
Ndiyo hivyo?

32
00:01:43,473 --> 00:01:46,887
Hapa kuna vyumba vingi.

33
00:01:46,911 --> 00:01:50,778
Ndiyo, kuna vyumba vinane kwa jumla.

34
00:01:50,801 --> 00:01:53,367
Unaishi peke yako?

35
00:01:53,390 --> 00:01:56,864
Ndiyo, ninaishi peke yangu.

36
00:01:56,887 --> 00:02:00,254
Je, familia yako iko Marekani?

37
00:02:00,277 --> 00:02:04,057
Ndiyo, wazazi wangu na dada yangu wako huko.

38
00:02:04,080 --> 00:02:06,888
Je, kuna tatizo lolote?

39
00:02:06,911 --> 00:02:10,968
Bado sijui duka la kununulia vitu.

40
00:02:10,991 --> 00:02:14,525
Kuna duka dogo karibu na hapa.

41
00:02:14,548 --> 00:02:17,434
Hufunguliwa saa ngapi?

42
00:02:17,457 --> 00:02:20,224
Hufunguliwa saa tatu asubuhi.

43
00:02:20,247 --> 00:02:23,299
Nimeelewa. Nitaenda kuangalia.

44
00:02:23,322 --> 00:02:26,211
Kuna mkate na maziwa.

45
00:02:26,234 --> 00:02:28,901
Hiyo ni nzuri.

46
00:02:28,924 --> 00:02:30,390
Nitasaidiwa sana.

47
00:02:30,413 --> 00:02:33,013
Unaweza kuuliza chochote.

48
00:02:33,036 --> 00:02:36,648
Asante, nitakuuliza.

49
00:02:36,672 --> 00:02:45,681
Skripu ya video ya leo inaweza kupakuliwa kwenye maelezo na kwenye maoni ya juu. Tafadhali weka maoni kabla ya kupakua.

50
00:02:45,681 --> 00:02:47,181
Sehemu ya 2: Zawadi ya mboga / Kujaliwa na kumpa mboga

51
00:02:47,181 --> 00:02:50,115
Mike, hujambo.

52
00:02:50,138 --> 00:02:52,938
Hujambo, u hali gani?

53
00:02:52,961 --> 00:02:56,327
Ndiyo, niko salama.

54
00:02:56,350 --> 00:02:59,484
Tumepata mboga shambani.

55
00:02:59,507 --> 00:03:02,576
Waa, mboga nyingi sana!

56
00:03:02,599 --> 00:03:05,015
Chukua hizi.

57
00:03:05,038 --> 00:03:07,056
Kula tafadhali.

58
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:10,748
Ni sawa hivi? Asante sana.

59
00:03:10,772 --> 00:03:14,138
Hizi ni nyanya, tango na biringani.

60
00:03:14,161 --> 00:03:16,764
Zote zinaonekana tamu sana.

61
00:03:16,788 --> 00:03:20,435
Nilivipata asubuhi ya leo shambani.

62
00:03:20,458 --> 00:03:23,309
Mboga hizi ni freshi sana!

63
00:03:23,332 --> 00:03:27,402
Je, ulikula mboga huko Marekani?

64
00:03:27,425 --> 00:03:30,858
Ndiyo. Lakini nilinunua sokoni.

65
00:03:30,881 --> 00:03:33,458
Je, huziotesha mwenyewe?

66
00:03:33,482 --> 00:03:37,938
Nyumbani kwangu New York hakukuwa na shamba.

67
00:03:37,961 --> 00:03:39,894
Ndiyo hivyo?

68
00:03:39,917 --> 00:03:43,851
Hapa vijijini kila mtu huwa na shamba.

69
00:03:43,874 --> 00:03:46,567
Hiyo ni nzuri sana.

70
00:03:46,590 --> 00:03:49,832
Mike, je, wewe hupika?

71
00:03:49,856 --> 00:03:53,022
Ndiyo. Mara kwa mara napika.

72
00:03:53,045 --> 00:03:56,289
Unakula nyanya vipi?

73
00:03:56,313 --> 00:03:58,313
Nazifanya saladi.

74
00:03:58,336 --> 00:04:01,936
Tango, weka chumvi kidogo kisha ule.

75
00:04:01,959 --> 00:04:05,226
Chumvi? Nitajaribu.

76
00:04:05,249 --> 00:04:08,416
Biringani ni tamu sana kwa tempura.

77
00:04:08,439 --> 00:04:11,572
Tempura? Napenda.

78
00:04:11,595 --> 00:04:14,762
Je, umewahi kupika tempura?

79
00:04:14,785 --> 00:04:18,260
Hapana, sijawahi.

80
00:04:18,283 --> 00:04:21,620
Mara ijayo nitakufundisha jinsi ya kupika.

81
00:04:21,644 --> 00:04:24,610
Kweli? Tafadhali nisaidie.

82
00:04:24,633 --> 00:04:28,000
Tafadhali pika chakula kingi.

83
00:04:28,023 --> 00:04:30,990
Ndiyo. Leo nitapika.

84
00:04:31,013 --> 00:04:34,179
Ukitaka kula na ushindwe, niambie.

85
00:04:34,202 --> 00:04:37,038
Ukitaka kula na ushindwe?

86
00:04:37,062 --> 00:04:40,997
Ndiyo. Nitapika na kukuletea.

87
00:04:41,020 --> 00:04:44,954
Kweli? Umekuwa mzuri sana.

88
00:04:44,977 --> 00:04:47,746
Hapa vijijini ni kawaida.

89
00:04:47,769 --> 00:04:49,569
Asante sana.

90
00:04:49,592 --> 00:04:51,559
Ninashukuru sana.

91
00:04:51,582 --> 00:04:58,687
Kiungo cha kurudia maudhui ya video ya leo kipo kwenye maelezo na maoni ya juu. *Tovuti inaweza kufutwa bila tahadhari.

92
00:04:58,687 --> 00:05:00,187
Sehemu ya 3: Jinsi ya Kutumia Dukani isiyo na Mtu / Jinsi ya Kutumia Dukani ya kujitegemea

93
00:05:00,187 --> 00:05:03,926
Mike, unaenda wapi?

94
00:05:03,950 --> 00:05:07,283
Ninataka kwenda sokoni.

95
00:05:07,306 --> 00:05:12,043
Aa, hakuna soko karibu na hapa.

96
00:05:12,066 --> 00:05:15,523
Eeh, hakuna?

97
00:05:15,547 --> 00:05:20,835
Soko lililo karibu zaidi ni kwa gari dakika 30.

98
00:05:20,858 --> 00:05:24,229
Dakika 30 kwa gari?

99
00:05:24,253 --> 00:05:27,820
Sina gari.

100
00:05:27,843 --> 00:05:30,916
Hiyo ni ngumu sana.

101
00:05:30,939 --> 00:05:34,318
Unanunua vitu wapi?

102
00:05:34,342 --> 00:05:37,996
Kuna duka lisilo na mtu.

103
00:05:38,020 --> 00:05:40,353
Duka lisilo na mtu?

104
00:05:40,376 --> 00:05:42,709
Hiyo ni nini?

105
00:05:42,732 --> 00:05:46,616
Ni duka dogo lisilo na watu.

106
00:05:46,640 --> 00:05:49,376
Hakuna watu?

107
00:05:49,399 --> 00:05:51,933
Unanunua vipi?

108
00:05:51,956 --> 00:05:56,689
Chagua mboga zako kisha weka pesa kwenye sanduku.

109
00:05:56,712 --> 00:05:59,945
Weka pesa kwenye sanduku?

110
00:05:59,968 --> 00:06:02,435
Haitakuliwa?

111
00:06:02,458 --> 00:06:05,269
Hakuna mtu atakayekula.

112
00:06:05,293 --> 00:06:07,365
Usijali.

113
00:06:07,388 --> 00:06:09,602
Hii ni nzuri sana!

114
00:06:09,625 --> 00:06:12,560
Huko Marekani hakuna.

115
00:06:12,584 --> 00:06:16,317
Kuna mboga zinazopikwa vizuri na bei nafuu.

116
00:06:16,340 --> 00:06:18,474
Zinagharimu kiasi gani?

117
00:06:18,497 --> 00:06:21,897
Shilingi mia moja au mia mbili.

118
00:06:21,919 --> 00:06:24,558
Bei rahisi sana!

119
00:06:24,581 --> 00:06:29,029
Pia, gari la kuuza bidhaa linakuja.

120
00:06:29,052 --> 00:06:31,386
Gari la kuuza bidhaa?

121
00:06:31,409 --> 00:06:35,775
Kuna chakula kingi ndani ya gari.

122
00:06:35,798 --> 00:06:38,965
Gari linakuja kuuza?

123
00:06:38,988 --> 00:06:40,794
Ndiyo.

124
00:06:40,818 --> 00:06:44,074
Linakuja Jumanne na Ijumaa.

125
00:06:44,097 --> 00:06:47,591
Kuna mkate na nyama pia?

126
00:06:47,615 --> 00:06:51,085
Kuna samaki na togwa pia.

127
00:06:51,108 --> 00:06:54,121
Kuna vitamu na vinywaji pia?

128
00:06:54,144 --> 00:06:55,678
Ndiyo.

129
00:06:55,701 --> 00:06:58,506
Kuna matunda pia.

130
00:06:58,530 --> 00:07:01,663
Hii ni rahisi sana!

131
00:07:01,686 --> 00:07:05,253
Litakuja leo saa nane mchana.

132
00:07:05,276 --> 00:07:07,609
Kuna sauti?

133
00:07:07,632 --> 00:07:09,205
Ndiyo.

134
00:07:09,229 --> 00:07:13,062
Ukisikia muziki, toka nje.

135
00:07:13,085 --> 00:07:15,118
Nimeelewa.

136
00:07:15,141 --> 00:07:17,512
Nitasubiri muziki.

137
00:07:17,536 --> 00:07:20,469
Twende kununua pamoja.

138
00:07:20,492 --> 00:07:22,189
Ndiyo.

139
00:07:22,213 --> 00:07:24,016
Tafadhali.

140
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:25,540
Sehemu ya 4: Mabasi ya Vijijini na Mjini / Mabasi: Marudio ya Vijijini dhidi ya Mjini

141
00:07:25,540 --> 00:07:30,073
Mike, unasimama kwenye kituo cha basi kufanya nini?

142
00:07:30,096 --> 00:07:33,429
Ninasubiri basi.

143
00:07:33,452 --> 00:07:37,185
Basi limekwenda sasa hivi.

144
00:07:37,208 --> 00:07:40,542
Kweli?

145
00:07:40,565 --> 00:07:45,413
Ndiyo. Inayofuata ni baada ya saa moja.

146
00:07:45,436 --> 00:07:48,170
Baada ya saa moja?

147
00:07:48,193 --> 00:07:51,252
Basi moja kwa saa moja?

148
00:07:51,276 --> 00:07:56,123
Ndiyo. Mabasi ya vijijini huwa na ratiba chache.

149
00:07:56,146 --> 00:08:01,631
Mabasi ya New York huja kila baada ya dakika tano.

150
00:08:01,654 --> 00:08:03,588
Dakika tano?

151
00:08:03,611 --> 00:08:06,377
Hiyo ni haraka sana!

152
00:08:06,400 --> 00:08:09,367
Nitasubiri kwa saa moja?

153
00:08:09,390 --> 00:08:11,524
Tatizo hili.

154
00:08:11,548 --> 00:08:14,121
Unataka kwenda wapi?

155
00:08:14,144 --> 00:08:17,014
Ninataka kwenda kwenye kituo cha treni.

156
00:08:17,038 --> 00:08:20,213
Utakutana na mtu wowote kwenye kituo cha treni?

157
00:08:20,236 --> 00:08:25,296
Hapana. Nitaenda mjini kwa treni.

158
00:08:25,319 --> 00:08:28,007
Unaenda kununua vitu?

159
00:08:28,030 --> 00:08:31,997
Ndiyo. Nitaenda kununua nguo na vitabu.

160
00:08:32,020 --> 00:08:34,820
Umeangalia ratiba ya saa?

161
00:08:34,842 --> 00:08:39,409
Ndiyo, lakini sikuelewa vizuri.

162
00:08:39,433 --> 00:08:42,799
Nitaakufundisha jinsi ya kusoma.

163
00:08:42,822 --> 00:08:44,598
Tafadhali.

164
00:08:44,622 --> 00:08:47,688
Hii ni ratiba ya siku za wiki.

165
00:08:47,711 --> 00:08:49,478
Ndiyo.

166
00:08:49,501 --> 00:08:52,741
Hii ni ratiba ya siku ya Jumamosi.

167
00:08:52,765 --> 00:08:56,398
Siku ya Jumapili iko wapi?

168
00:08:56,421 --> 00:09:00,188
Hakuna basi siku ya Jumapili.

169
00:09:00,211 --> 00:09:05,260
Eeh! Hakuna basi siku ya Jumapili?

170
00:09:05,283 --> 00:09:09,016
Ndiyo. Ni siku ya mapumziko.

171
00:09:09,039 --> 00:09:11,850
Hiyo ni ngumu sana.

172
00:09:11,873 --> 00:09:14,772
Utatumia baiskeli?

173
00:09:14,796 --> 00:09:17,563
Nina baiskeli.

174
00:09:17,586 --> 00:09:21,386
Kwa baiskeli, ni dakika ishirini hadi kituo cha treni.

175
00:09:21,409 --> 00:09:25,476
Ni haraka zaidi kuliko kungoja basi.

176
00:09:25,499 --> 00:09:29,343
Leo naweza kukusaidia kwa gari langu?

177
00:09:29,367 --> 00:09:31,300
Kweli?

178
00:09:31,323 --> 00:09:33,690
Nitasaidiwa sana.

179
00:09:33,713 --> 00:09:37,532
Kwa gari, tutafika ndani ya dakika kumi.

180
00:09:37,555 --> 00:09:39,161
Asante sana.

181
00:09:39,185 --> 00:09:41,520
Nipandisha tafadhali.

182
00:09:41,544 --> 00:09:43,044
Sehemu ya 5: Jinsi ya Kukabiliana na Wadudu

183
00:09:43,044 --> 00:09:46,329
Mike, umeshindwa nini?

184
00:09:46,352 --> 00:09:49,223
Tafadhali, nisaidie!

185
00:09:49,246 --> 00:09:51,328
Umefanya nini?

186
00:09:51,351 --> 00:09:55,442
Kuna mdudu mkubwa ndani ya chumba.

187
00:09:55,466 --> 00:09:57,948
Mdudu mkubwa?

188
00:09:57,971 --> 00:10:00,138
Nitakwenda kuangalia.

189
00:10:00,161 --> 00:10:02,100
Yuko pale.

190
00:10:02,124 --> 00:10:03,757
Yuko ukutani.

191
00:10:03,780 --> 00:10:06,914
Aa, ni tandu.

192
00:10:06,937 --> 00:10:08,908
Tandu?

193
00:10:08,931 --> 00:10:11,105
Una sumu?

194
00:10:11,128 --> 00:10:13,613
Kuna kidogo.

195
00:10:13,636 --> 00:10:15,810
Usiguse.

196
00:10:15,834 --> 00:10:17,726
Ninahofia.

197
00:10:17,750 --> 00:10:19,516
Tutafanya nini?

198
00:10:19,539 --> 00:10:22,198
Tutatumia spreyi hii.

199
00:10:22,221 --> 00:10:25,255
Spreyi ambayo inatoa sauti ya 'shuu'?

200
00:10:25,278 --> 00:10:26,717
Ndiyo.

201
00:10:26,741 --> 00:10:29,038
Hii itamfanya aondoke.

202
00:10:29,061 --> 00:10:30,948
Asante sana.

203
00:10:30,972 --> 00:10:33,027
Umenisaidia sana.

204
00:10:33,050 --> 00:10:36,319
Je, hawako katika nyumba za Marekani?

205
00:10:36,343 --> 00:10:39,756
Hakukuwa katika ghorofa za New York.

206
00:10:39,780 --> 00:10:43,813
Nyumba za kale zimetengenezwa kwa mbao na udongo.

207
00:10:43,836 --> 00:10:46,691
Wadudu wanapata njia ya kuingia kwa urahisi, basi?

208
00:10:46,715 --> 00:10:48,548
Ndiyo.

209
00:10:48,571 --> 00:10:51,204
Kwa sababu milima iko karibu.

210
00:10:51,227 --> 00:10:53,761
Je, wadudu wengine pia wanatokea?

211
00:10:53,784 --> 00:10:57,680
Wakati wa kiangazi, buzi na buibui wanatokea.

212
00:10:57,703 --> 00:11:00,797
Buzi ni mdudu anayetoa harufu mbaya?

213
00:11:00,821 --> 00:11:02,555
Ndiyo.

214
00:11:02,578 --> 00:11:05,476
Ukigusa utasikia harufu mbaya sana.

215
00:11:05,499 --> 00:11:07,866
Nitaifanyaje ili kuitoa nje?

216
00:11:07,889 --> 00:11:12,387
Weka kwenye karatasi na utie nje polepole.

217
00:11:12,410 --> 00:11:14,743
Je, siwezi kukupiga?

218
00:11:14,766 --> 00:11:16,200
Ndiyo.

219
00:11:16,223 --> 00:11:19,223
Ukikipiga utasikia harufu mbaya zaidi.

220
00:11:19,246 --> 00:11:20,862
Aa, nimeelewa.

221
00:11:20,885 --> 00:11:22,928
Nitakumbuka.

222
00:11:22,951 --> 00:11:25,569
Tufunge madirisha.

223
00:11:25,593 --> 00:11:27,059
Ndiyo.

224
00:11:27,082 --> 00:11:29,649
Tuhakikishe pia kuwa mtando wa dirisha umefungwa vizuri.

225
00:11:29,672 --> 00:11:32,739
Tununue dawa ya kuzuia wadudu.

226
00:11:32,762 --> 00:11:34,795
Ninunua wapi?

227
00:11:34,818 --> 00:11:37,390
Inauzwa katika duka la dawa.

228
00:11:37,414 --> 00:11:39,814
Nitakwenda kununua leo.

229
00:11:39,837 --> 00:11:41,337
Mchezo wa 6: Shughuli ya Usafi wa Kijiji

230
00:11:41,337 --> 00:11:45,937
Bwana Mike, kesho asubuhi utakuwa na shughuli nyingi?

231
00:11:45,960 --> 00:11:49,575
Hapana, nitaacha.

232
00:11:49,598 --> 00:11:51,211
Kwa nini?

233
00:11:51,235 --> 00:11:55,814
Kesho ni siku ya usafi wa kijiji.

234
00:11:55,837 --> 00:11:58,070
Usafi wa kijiji?

235
00:11:58,093 --> 00:12:00,266
Hiyo ni nini?

236
00:12:00,289 --> 00:12:04,575
Tutakusanya takataka kwenye barabara pamoja.

237
00:12:04,598 --> 00:12:06,732
Ndiyo hivyo?

238
00:12:06,755 --> 00:12:09,634
Itaanza saa ngapi?

239
00:12:09,657 --> 00:12:12,457
Saa moja asubuhi.

240
00:12:12,481 --> 00:12:15,373
Saa moja asubuhi?

241
00:12:15,397 --> 00:12:17,964
Ni mapema sana!

242
00:12:17,987 --> 00:12:22,793
Ndiyo, tutafanya kabla ya jua kutoka.

243
00:12:22,817 --> 00:12:25,217
Tutakutana wapi?

244
00:12:25,240 --> 00:12:28,773
Tutakutana mbele ya bustani.

245
00:12:28,796 --> 00:12:31,363
Tunahitaji kuchukua nini?

246
00:12:31,386 --> 00:12:35,605
Chukua glavu na mifuko ya takataka tafadhali.

247
00:12:35,628 --> 00:12:37,228
Glavu?

248
00:12:37,251 --> 00:12:40,051
Glavu ni nini?

249
00:12:40,074 --> 00:12:43,674
Ni glavu nyeupe za kitambaa.

250
00:12:43,697 --> 00:12:45,914
Nimeelewa.

251
00:12:45,937 --> 00:12:48,510
Je, tutatawanya majani pia?

252
00:12:48,534 --> 00:12:50,148
Ndiyo.

253
00:12:50,171 --> 00:12:53,138
Tutatawanya majani karibu na mto.

254
00:12:53,161 --> 00:12:56,161
Je, zipo zana?

255
00:12:56,184 --> 00:12:59,665
Nitakupa mkasi mkubwa.

256
00:12:59,689 --> 00:13:01,555
Asante sana.

257
00:13:01,578 --> 00:13:05,013
Njoo ukiwa na buti za mvua tafadhali.

258
00:13:05,037 --> 00:13:07,171
Buti za mvua?

259
00:13:07,194 --> 00:13:09,492
Nina nazo.

260
00:13:09,515 --> 00:13:12,327
Hiyo ni nzuri.

261
00:13:12,350 --> 00:13:15,428
Je, watu wote wa kijiji watakuja?

262
00:13:15,452 --> 00:13:17,222
Ndiyo.

263
00:13:17,245 --> 00:13:20,184
Watu kama ishirini hivi watakutana.

264
00:13:20,207 --> 00:13:24,207
Huko Marekani hatukuwa na shughuli kama hizi.

265
00:13:24,230 --> 00:13:27,697
Tutausafisha kijiji pamoja.

266
00:13:27,720 --> 00:13:31,732
Ni desturi nzuri sana!

267
00:13:31,756 --> 00:13:35,164
Baada ya usafi, tutakunywa chai.

268
00:13:35,187 --> 00:13:36,874
Chai?

269
00:13:36,898 --> 00:13:39,031
Inaonekana kuwa ya furaha!

270
00:13:39,054 --> 00:13:42,546
Utaweza kuwa rafiki na watu wa kijiji.

271
00:13:42,570 --> 00:13:45,255
Hiyo ni nzuri sana.

272
00:13:45,278 --> 00:13:47,644
Ninafurahi sana!

273
00:13:47,667 --> 00:13:51,701
Nitakujia kukuita kesho asubuhi.

274
00:13:51,724 --> 00:13:54,198
Tafadhali, nakuomba.

275
00:13:54,221 --> 00:13:55,721
Mchezo 7: Chai na Machtani / Chai na Machungwa

276
00:13:55,721 --> 00:13:59,088
Mike, hujambo.

277
00:13:59,111 --> 00:14:01,477
Naweza kuingia?

278
00:14:01,500 --> 00:14:06,434
Ndiyo, karibu. Ingia.

279
00:14:06,457 --> 00:14:09,354
Nimefanya machtani.

280
00:14:09,377 --> 00:14:12,144
Nimeleta.

281
00:14:12,167 --> 00:14:14,734
Machtani?

282
00:14:14,757 --> 00:14:16,523
Asante sana.

283
00:14:16,546 --> 00:14:19,788
Tunywane chai wakati tunakula machtani.

284
00:14:19,812 --> 00:14:21,746
Sawa sana.

285
00:14:21,769 --> 00:14:24,405
Nitapika chai.

286
00:14:24,428 --> 00:14:27,518
Ungependa chai moto?

287
00:14:27,541 --> 00:14:31,708
Ndiyo, napenda chai ya kijani moto.

288
00:14:31,731 --> 00:14:35,764
Hizi ni machtani za muhogo.

289
00:14:35,787 --> 00:14:39,636
Machtani nyeupe na nzuri sana.

290
00:14:39,659 --> 00:14:44,096
Zina uchachu kidogo, lakini ni tamu.

291
00:14:44,120 --> 00:14:46,214
Nitakula.

292
00:14:46,238 --> 00:14:50,049
Hmm, ni tamu sana.

293
00:14:50,072 --> 00:14:52,691
Nimefurahi.

294
00:14:52,714 --> 00:14:55,447
Zimepatikana na ladha yako?

295
00:14:55,470 --> 00:14:59,737
Ndiyo, zina tabia ya kuvunja na ni tamu.

296
00:14:59,760 --> 00:15:03,001
Nimezipika mwenyewe.

297
00:15:03,025 --> 00:15:05,714
Unaweza kuzipika mwenyewe?

298
00:15:05,738 --> 00:15:08,071
Ni ajabu!

299
00:15:08,094 --> 00:15:12,743
Bibi zote kijijini huzipika.

300
00:15:12,766 --> 00:15:17,166
Nchini Marekani tunakula pickles.

301
00:15:17,189 --> 00:15:19,563
Pickles?

302
00:15:19,587 --> 00:15:22,454
Ni sawa na machtani, ndiyo?

303
00:15:22,477 --> 00:15:26,877
Ndiyo, lakini ladha ni tofauti kidogo.

304
00:15:26,900 --> 00:15:31,105
Tunatumia shoyu na chumvi ya Kijapani.

305
00:15:31,128 --> 00:15:35,584
Naelewa, inaonekana ni nzuri kwa afya.

306
00:15:35,607 --> 00:15:40,253
Ndiyo, ni nzuri sana kwa afya.

307
00:15:40,276 --> 00:15:43,152
Unazila kila siku?

308
00:15:43,176 --> 00:15:48,709
Ndiyo, lazima nizila wakati wa kifungua kinywa.

309
00:15:48,732 --> 00:15:52,369
Unaweza kunionyesha jinsi ya kuzipika?

310
00:15:52,393 --> 00:15:56,996
Bila shaka. Ni rahisi.

311
00:15:57,020 --> 00:16:00,253
Utaonyesha lini?

312
00:16:00,276 --> 00:16:03,876
Tutazipika pamoja wiki ijayo.

313
00:16:03,899 --> 00:16:06,699
Ninashukuru sana.

314
00:16:06,722 --> 00:16:09,289
Ninasubiri kwa hamu.

315
00:16:09,312 --> 00:16:13,318
Nitakuchukua muhogo shambani.

316
00:16:13,342 --> 00:16:17,508
Kutoka shambani? Ni bora sana!

317
00:16:17,531 --> 00:16:20,398
Ungependa chai zaidi?

318
00:16:20,421 --> 00:16:24,038
Ndiyo, nitakunywa.

319
00:16:24,061 --> 00:16:25,561
Mchezo 8: Maandalizi ya Tamasha / Maandalizi ya Sikukuu

320
00:16:25,561 --> 00:16:29,928
Mike, karibu na msimu wa vuli.

321
00:16:29,951 --> 00:16:34,518
Ndiyo. Upepo umekuwa baridi.

322
00:16:34,541 --> 00:16:39,474
Jumapili ijayo ni sikukuu ya hekaluni.

323
00:16:39,497 --> 00:16:41,830
Sikukuu?

324
00:16:41,853 --> 00:16:44,261
Inaonekana kuwa ya kufurahisha.

325
00:16:44,285 --> 00:16:47,652
Tutakuwa tunafanya maandalizi Jumamosi.

326
00:16:47,675 --> 00:16:50,408
Unaweza kunisaidia?

327
00:16:50,431 --> 00:16:52,570
Ndiyo, bila shaka.

328
00:16:52,593 --> 00:16:55,332
Nikupe nini msaada?

329
00:16:55,356 --> 00:16:58,189
Tutakataza chochín.

330
00:16:58,212 --> 00:17:00,214
Chochín?

331
00:17:00,238 --> 00:17:03,238
Chochín ni nini?

332
00:17:03,261 --> 00:17:07,028
Ni taa iliyotengenezwa kwa karatasi.

333
00:17:07,051 --> 00:17:09,509
Nyekundu na mviringo.

334
00:17:09,533 --> 00:17:11,909
Aa, naijua.

335
00:17:11,932 --> 00:17:14,066
Nzuri sana!

336
00:17:14,089 --> 00:17:18,302
Kisha, tutasafisha mikoshi.

337
00:17:18,325 --> 00:17:20,492
Mikoshi?

338
00:17:20,515 --> 00:17:24,759
Ndiyo, ni chombo cha Mungu.

339
00:17:24,783 --> 00:17:27,787
Mikoshi ni nzito?

340
00:17:27,810 --> 00:17:30,748
Ndiyo, ni nzito sana.

341
00:17:30,772 --> 00:17:33,449
Tutashikilia pamoja.

342
00:17:33,473 --> 00:17:37,006
Siku hiyo naweza kushikilia pia?

343
00:17:37,029 --> 00:17:41,729
Ndiyo, Mike, tafadhali shikilia pamoja nasi.

344
00:17:41,752 --> 00:17:44,885
Waa! Natamani kujaribu.

345
00:17:44,908 --> 00:17:47,912
Tutavaa nguo maalum.

346
00:17:47,936 --> 00:17:50,336
Ni happi.

347
00:17:50,359 --> 00:17:52,293
Happi?

348
00:17:52,316 --> 00:17:54,550
Inaonekana nzuri sana!

349
00:17:54,573 --> 00:17:58,573
Nitakupatia happi ya buluu.

350
00:17:58,596 --> 00:18:00,529
Asante sana.

351
00:18:00,552 --> 00:18:02,796
Ninafurahi sana!

352
00:18:02,820 --> 00:18:06,257
Nchini Marekani kuna sherehe?

353
00:18:06,280 --> 00:18:08,680
Kuna parade.

354
00:18:08,703 --> 00:18:12,108
Lakini hakuna mikoshi.

355
00:18:12,132 --> 00:18:16,665
Sherehe za Japani ni za furaha sana.

356
00:18:16,688 --> 00:18:18,728
Kuna maduka ya nje pia?

357
00:18:18,752 --> 00:18:23,368
Ndiyo, kuna maduka ya takoyaki na yakisoba.

358
00:18:23,391 --> 00:18:25,470
Inaonekana kuwa tamu!

359
00:18:25,493 --> 00:18:27,942
Natamani kula.

360
00:18:27,965 --> 00:18:31,264
Usiku kuna moto wa nyota pia.

361
00:18:31,288 --> 00:18:33,455
Moto wa nyota?

362
00:18:33,478 --> 00:18:35,811
Ni nzuri mno!

363
00:18:35,834 --> 00:18:39,634
Chukua picha nyingi, tafadhali.

364
00:18:39,657 --> 00:18:42,591
Nitawaonyesha familia yangu nchini Marekani.

365
00:18:42,614 --> 00:18:46,790
Kuja Hekaluni saa tatu asubuhi ya Jumamosi.

366
00:18:46,813 --> 00:18:50,246
Ndiyo, nitakuja bila shaka.

367
00:18:50,269 --> 00:18:51,769
Mandhari ya 9: Baridi ya Majira ya Baridi na Majiko ya Kuni

368
00:18:51,769 --> 00:18:56,369
Mike, baridi imeanza sasa hivi.

369
00:18:56,392 --> 00:19:01,130
Ndiyo, asubuhi na usiku ni baridi sana.

370
00:19:01,154 --> 00:19:05,425
Baridi zaidi ni katika vijijini wakati wa majira ya baridi.

371
00:19:05,448 --> 00:19:07,887
Je, theluthi inanyesha?

372
00:19:07,911 --> 00:19:11,006
Ndiyo, inanyesha sana.

373
00:19:11,029 --> 00:19:13,862
Je, ndani ya nyumba pia ni baridi?

374
00:19:13,886 --> 00:19:18,760
Ndiyo, nyumba za kale zina upepo unaopenya.

375
00:19:18,783 --> 00:19:21,116
Upepo unaopenya?

376
00:19:21,139 --> 00:19:23,424
Nifanyeje?

377
00:19:23,448 --> 00:19:26,381
Tutumie jiko la kuni.

378
00:19:26,404 --> 00:19:28,604
Moto wa kuni?

379
00:19:28,627 --> 00:19:32,194
Je, ni jiko linalotumia kuni?

380
00:19:32,217 --> 00:19:35,785
Ndiyo, inafanya joto sana!

381
00:19:35,809 --> 00:19:38,342
Kuni ziko wapi?

382
00:19:38,365 --> 00:19:41,639
Kuna kuni nyingi bustanini.

383
00:19:41,662 --> 00:19:45,239
Kwa hiyo, unazileta ndani ya nyumba?

384
00:19:45,263 --> 00:19:48,530
Ndiyo, nazileta kila siku.

385
00:19:48,553 --> 00:19:51,166
Zinaonekana nzito sana.

386
00:19:51,189 --> 00:19:56,163
Ndiyo, lakini ni mazoezi mazuri.

387
00:19:56,187 --> 00:20:00,454
Nyumbani New York tulikuwa na mfumo wa kupasha joto wa kati.

388
00:20:00,477 --> 00:20:02,736
Hiyo ni nini?

389
00:20:02,759 --> 00:20:07,992
Unapobonyeza kitufe, chumba chote kinakuwa joto.

390
00:20:08,015 --> 00:20:10,815
Haya, hiyo ni rahisi sana!

391
00:20:10,838 --> 00:20:14,073
Maisha ya vijijini huhitaji nguvu za mwili.

392
00:20:14,097 --> 00:20:17,864
Je, unagawanya kuni mwenyewe?

393
00:20:17,887 --> 00:20:20,853
Ndiyo, naitumia shoka.

394
00:20:20,876 --> 00:20:24,893
Shoka? Inaonekana ngumu kidogo.

395
00:20:24,916 --> 00:20:28,483
Nitakufundisha mbinu, utakuwa sawa.

396
00:20:28,506 --> 00:20:30,977
Nitajaribu kwa bidii.

397
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:33,680
Je, ungependa kujaribu kotatsu?

398
00:20:33,704 --> 00:20:35,937
Kotatsu?

399
00:20:35,960 --> 00:20:37,994
Ni kitu gani?

400
00:20:38,017 --> 00:20:41,095
Ni meza yenye joto!

401
00:20:41,118 --> 00:20:44,956
Kula machungwa chini ya kotatsu ni bora kabisa.

402
00:20:44,980 --> 00:20:47,513
Hiyo ni nzuri sana!

403
00:20:47,536 --> 00:20:49,803
Ningependa kujaribu.

404
00:20:49,826 --> 00:20:53,559
Nitakuletea kotatsu kesho.

405
00:20:53,582 --> 00:20:55,249
Kweli?

406
00:20:55,272 --> 00:20:57,672
Asante sana.

407
00:20:57,695 --> 00:20:59,195
Mandhari ya 10: Urembo wa Anga ya Usiku

408
00:20:59,195 --> 00:21:03,761
Mike, leo usiku anga ni nzuri sana, sivyo?

409
00:21:03,784 --> 00:21:06,042
Ndiyo, kweli.

410
00:21:06,066 --> 00:21:10,032
Nyota nyingi sana zinonekana.

411
00:21:10,055 --> 00:21:13,222
Hapa vijijini hewa ni safi.

412
00:21:13,245 --> 00:21:17,323
New York nyota hazikuonekana.

413
00:21:17,347 --> 00:21:19,422
Kwa nini?

414
00:21:19,445 --> 00:21:23,612
Mwanga wa majengo ulikuwa mkali mno.

415
00:21:23,635 --> 00:21:25,402
Aa, nimeelewa.

416
00:21:25,425 --> 00:21:29,592
Hapa usiku huwa giza kabisa.

417
00:21:29,615 --> 00:21:33,274
Mwanzoni nilikuwa naogopa giza hili.

418
00:21:33,297 --> 00:21:36,265
Sasa unahisi vipi?

419
00:21:36,289 --> 00:21:40,165
Sasa napenda utulivu huu.

420
00:21:40,188 --> 00:21:43,081
Umezoea maisha ya vijijini?

421
00:21:43,105 --> 00:21:44,783
Ndiyo.

422
00:21:44,806 --> 00:21:47,374
Kila siku ni furaha.

423
00:21:47,398 --> 00:21:50,454
Mandhari ya mchana pia ni nzuri, sivyo?

424
00:21:50,477 --> 00:21:51,965
Ndiyo.

425
00:21:51,989 --> 00:21:55,356
Rangi za milima ni nzuri sana.

426
00:21:55,379 --> 00:21:59,779
Msimu wa machipuko ni kijani, na msimu wa majani ni nyekundu.

427
00:21:59,802 --> 00:22:03,574
Mabadiliko ya majira yanajitambulisha vizuri.

428
00:22:03,597 --> 00:22:07,964
Maji ya mto pia ni baridi sana na safi.

429
00:22:07,987 --> 00:22:10,387
Kuna samaki?

430
00:22:10,410 --> 00:22:11,863
Ndiyo.

431
00:22:11,886 --> 00:22:15,854
Samaki wadogo wanaogelea wengi.

432
00:22:15,878 --> 00:22:19,044
Mara nyingine ningependa kujaribu kuvua samaki mtoni.

433
00:22:19,067 --> 00:22:20,834
Sawa sana.

434
00:22:20,857 --> 00:22:23,835
Nitakukopesha vifaa vya uvuvi.

435
00:22:23,858 --> 00:22:25,459
Asante sana.

436
00:22:25,483 --> 00:22:29,661
Umekuwa rafiki na majirani pia, sivyo?

437
00:22:29,685 --> 00:22:33,051
Ndiyo, mnavyojali sana nyote.

438
00:22:33,074 --> 00:22:37,120
Kwa sababu Mike anaguswa na tabasamu.

439
00:22:37,144 --> 00:22:39,877
Salamu ni muhimu sana, sivyo?

440
00:22:39,900 --> 00:22:43,467
Unafikiria kurudi mjini?

441
00:22:43,490 --> 00:22:47,580
Hapana, sio kabisa.

442
00:22:47,603 --> 00:22:50,570
Nimefurahi kusikia hivyo.

443
00:22:50,593 --> 00:22:53,926
Nataka kuishi hapa milele.

444
00:22:53,949 --> 00:22:58,483
Kesho twende kwenye kiwanja cha kutazama kilichopo juu ya mlima.

445
00:22:58,506 --> 00:23:00,472
Kiwanja cha kutazama?

446
00:23:00,495 --> 00:23:03,262
Mahali pa kuona mandhari?

447
00:23:03,285 --> 00:23:05,018
Ndiyo.

448
00:23:05,041 --> 00:23:07,849
Unaweza kuona kijiji chote kutoka huko.

449
00:23:07,873 --> 00:23:10,007
Nataka kwenda.

450
00:23:10,030 --> 00:23:12,301
Tutakwenda kwa nini?

451
00:23:12,324 --> 00:23:14,991
Twende kwa baiskeli.

452
00:23:15,014 --> 00:23:16,780
Sawa sana.

453
00:23:16,803 --> 00:23:19,416
Ninasubiri kwa hamu.